# MDReader — a Tauri 2 app (Rust backend in src-tauri/, plain HTML/JS front end in src/).

# ── Rust / Cargo / Tauri ─────────────────────────────────────────
# Cargo.lock is committed on purpose: this is an application.
src-tauri/target/
/target/
# Regenerated by tauri-build on every build (capability schemas).
src-tauri/gen/
**/*.rs.bk
*.pdb

# ── Node ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# package-lock.json is committed on purpose.
node_modules/
.npm/
.eslintcache
.cache/
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*

# ── Env files, secrets and signing material ──────────────────────
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.p12
*.pfx
*.key
*.keystore
*.mobileprovision
*.provisionprofile

